<title>PHILIPPINES: Cosmos sees 205.789 mln pesos 1996 net.</title>
<headline>Cosmos sees 205.789 mln pesos 1996 net.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine soft drinks bottler Cosmos Bottling Corp said on Friday it expected a net income in full-year 1996 of 205.789 million pesos against 144 million pesos in 1995.</p>
</text>
